<title>GERMANY: SKW Trostberg says no lower 97 dividend.</title>
<headline>SKW Trostberg says no lower 97 dividend.</headline>
<dateline>MUNICH, Germany 1997-05-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>German speciality chemicals group SKW Trostberg AG said on Wednesday there was no danger of a lower dividend in 1997.</p>
<p>The company also said it hoped to boost its operating return on sales to 10 percent by 1998 and that a capital increase was possible starting in the second half of the year.</p>
</text>
